{"t": 1794123789.1623414, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"issue_key": "PAY-618", "body": "Investigated production Sentry issue CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q in acme/checkout-web: PromoNotFound for code ' autumn24 ', with 2,940 events and Android 15 / android 8.2 tags. Sentry attributes the input to Android keyboard spaces and lower-case.\n\nImplemented the agreed product + mobile fix locally in checkout/promo.py: normalize_code now uses code.strip().replace(\" \", \"\").upper(), stripping surrounding whitespace, removing inner spaces, and uppercasing before lookup.\n\nAdded tests/test_promo.py with 8 input cases covering the reported input, internal spaces, surrounding whitespace, lowercase, already-normalized input, empty/space-only input, punctuation preservation, and idempotence. Verification: `python -m unittest discover -s tests -v` passed (1 test method, 8 subtest cases).\n\nChanges are local only; not committed or deployed. The workspace has no Git repository metadata."}, "ok": true}
